        "method": [
          {
            "x4_code": null,
            "free_txt": [
              "Method of weighted least-squares taking into account",
              " correlations was used in the simultaneous evaluation",
              "Selection of experimental data:",
              " 204 cross section measurements around 14 MeV (155",
